OL,3,AFather leaves 7-year-old son alone on
OL,4,AMount Fuji to continue hike
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father has been reprimanded by police
OL,7,Fafter leaving his son on Japan's
OL,8,Fhighest mountain for several hours with
OL,9,Fjust a soft drink and snack.
OL,11,FThe seven-year-old was spotted sitting
OL,12,Fon a bench on Mount Fuji in foggy and
OL,13,Frainy conditions, at a point situated
OL,14,Fat over 2,000m (6,500ft).
OL,16,FHis father, 48, reportedly told him to
OL,17,F"wait here" after the boy complained he
OL,18,Fwas tired - and continued the climb
OL,19,Fwith his elder son.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
